ADVICE: <none | newest first, one line per advisor question or discussion: <model> <effort>, <{{if .Both}}cross-provider|{{end}}same-provider|unknown>, <native|CLI>[ behavioral] — <question> → <complete|partial (uncovered: …)|failed (<reason>)>: <conclusion>; <adopted|rejected: why>[; report <path>]>
DELEGATION STATE: <none | each child not confirmed stopped, or owning an unintegrated or uncleaned worktree, branch or kept session: role, model, task or session ID, PID, worktree path and branch, state, next step, recovery>
REPO CONSTRAINTS:
- <hard rules only>
